
---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Organic Intelligence-informed coaching for traders navigating pressure, uncertainty and high-performance decision-making."
    />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#f7f6f2" />
    <title>Trading Mind — Coaching for Traders</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;450;500;550;600;650;700&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="first-screen">
      <header class="site-header">
        <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Trading Mind home">trading<span>mind</span></a>

        <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Main navigation">
          <a href="/">Coaching</a>
          <a href="/course">Free course</a>
          <a class="nav-cta" href="#contact">Get in touch</a>
        </nav>
      </header>

      <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <h1>Develop your <em>nervous system capacity</em></h1>

          <p class="hero-description">
            One-to-one coaching for traders who want to improve performance and manage the stress of trading
          </p>

          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="button button-dark" href="#contact">Explore coaching</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <main>
      

<section class="editorial-intro" id="approach">
  <div class="editorial-intro__inner">
    <div class="intro-grid">
      <div class="intro-card">
        <h2>The challenge</h2>
        <p>
          Trading asks a lot of you psychologically. Uncertainty, losses,
          risk and missed opportunities can place sustained demands on your
          ability to think clearly and act with intention.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="intro-card">
        <h2>A different approach</h2>
        <p>
          Knowing what to do and being able to do it under pressure are
          two different things. Rather than focusing only on strategy,
          we work with the person navigating the demands of trading.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="intro-card">
        <h2>How it works</h2>
        <p>
          Through one-to-one coaching informed by Organic Intelligence,
          we develop your capacity to meet pressure, recover from setbacks
          and approach trading with greater flexibility and clarity.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


      <section class="contact-section" id="contact">
        <h2>Interested in working together?</h2>
        <a
          class="button button-light"
          href="https://x.com/youngtilopa"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
        >
          Get in touch
        </a>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      <a class="brand footer-brand" href="/">trading<span>mind</span></a>
      <p class="copyright">© {year} Trading Mind</p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :root {
    color-scheme: light;
    --paper: #f7f6f2;
    --ink: #262822;
    --muted: #77796f;
    --olive: #858c70;
    --line: #deded5;
    --soft: #eeeee7;
  }

  :global(*) {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  :global(html) {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
    scroll-padding-top: 100px;
  }

  :global(body) {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: "DM Sans", Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  :global(a), :global(a:visited) {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  :global(a:focus-visible) {
    outline: 2px solid var(--olive);
    outline-offset: 5px;
  }

  /* First screen: header and hero fill one viewport */

  .first-screen {
    height: 100vh;
    height: 100svh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .site-header {
    min-height: 86px;
    padding: 0 7.2%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 28px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .brand {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    white-space: nowrap;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 650;
    letter-spacing: -1.25px;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .brand > span {
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .nav-links {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    gap: clamp(17px, 2.6vw, 38px);
  }

  .nav-links a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    color: #55574f;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    white-space: nowrap;
    transition: color 160ms ease, background 160ms ease;
  }

  .nav-links a:hover {
    color: var(--olive);
  }

  .nav-links .nav-cta {
    padding: 10px 15px;
    border: 1px solid #c9cabe;
    border-radius: 2px;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .nav-links .nav-cta:hover {
    background: var(--ink);
    border-color: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
  }

  .hero {
    flex: 1;
    min-height: 0;
    padding: 60px 7.2%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .hero-copy {
    max-width: 790px;
  }

  h1, h2, p {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  h1 {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
    font-size: clamp(43px, 6.2vw, 77px);
    font-weight: 450;
    letter-spacing: -4.4px;
    line-height: 1.07;
  }

  h1 em {
    color: var(--olive);
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .hero-description {
    max-width: 500px;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .button {
    min-height: 47px;
    padding: 0 19px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 550;
    transition: background 160ms ease, color 160ms ease;
  }

  .button-dark, .button-dark:visited {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: #fff !important;
  }

  .button-dark:hover {
    background: #45483d;
  }

  /* Two-column coaching text */

 
/* Second section: editorial introduction */



/* Three-column introduction */

.editorial-intro {
  background: #f7f6f2;
  padding: 72px 0 80px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #e3e2da;
}

.editorial-intro__inner {
  width: min(100% - 64px, 1120px);
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.intro-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 24px;
}

.intro-card {
  background: transparent;
  border: 1px solid #e3e2da;
  border-radius: 6px;
  padding: 30px 26px;
}

.intro-card h2 {
  margin: 0 0 18px;
  color: #262822;
  font-size: 20px;
  font-weight: 500;
  line-height: 1.4;
  letter-spacing: -0.025em;
}

.intro-card p {
  margin: 0;
  color: #62635c;
  font-size: 15px;
  font-weight: 400;
  line-height: 1.85;
}

/* Mobile */

@media (max-width: 700px) {
  .editorial-intro {
    padding: 48px 0 56px;
  }

  .editorial-intro__inner {
    width: calc(100% - 40px);
  }

  .intro-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .intro-card {
    padding: 24px 22px;
  }

  .intro-card h2 {
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    font-size: 19px;
  }
}



  /* Contact section */

  .contact-section {
    padding: 88px 7.2% 96px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .contact-section h2 {
    margin-bottom: 27px;
    font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 44px);
    font-weight: 450;
    letter-spacing: -2px;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .button-light, .button-light:visited {
    border: 1px solid #c9cabe;
    color: var(--ink) !important;
  }

  .button-light:hover {
    background: var(--soft);
  }

  .site-footer {
    min-height: 83px;
    padding: 22px 7.2%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 18px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .footer-brand {
    font-size: 18px;
  }

  .site-footer p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 11px;
  }

  /* Large screens */

  @media (min-width: 1500px) {
    .site-header, .hero, .text-section,
    .contact-section, .site-footer {
      padding-left: max(7.2%, calc((100vw - 1240px) / 2));
      padding-right: max(7.2%, calc((100vw - 1240px) / 2));
    }
  }

  /* Mobile and smaller screens */

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .site-header {
      min-height: auto;
      padding: 23px 6%;
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 21px;
    }

    .nav-links {
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: flex-start;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px 21px;
    }

    .nav-links a {
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .nav-links .nav-cta {
      padding: 7px 10px;
    }

    .hero {
      padding: 45px 6%;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(40px, 10vw, 65px);
      letter-spacing: -2.8px;
    }

    .text-section {
      padding: 68px 6% 76px;
    }

    .text-content {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 28px;
    }

    .text-heading h2 {
      max-width: 500px;
      font-size: clamp(34px, 8vw, 42px);
      letter-spacing: -1.4px;
    }

    .text-body p {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.9;
    }

    .text-body .text-lead {
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .contact-section {
      padding: 70px 6%;
    }

    .site-footer {
      padding: 24px 6%;
    }
  }

  /* Extra spacing adjustment for short screens */

  @media (max-height: 750px) {
    .hero {
      padding-top: 35px;
      padding-bottom: 35px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(40px, 5.5vw, 65px);
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    :global(html) {
      scroll-behavior: auto;
    }

    :global(*), :global(*::before), :global(*::after) {
      transition: none !important;
    }
  }
</style>
